Yamaha DX7 PATCH DATA

This is a list of about 30,000 unique patches for the Yamaha DX7 meant as research training data.  
Each patch is on its own line, and contains 145 numerical parameters, comma separated.  Also provided
are the NAMES for each of the parameters, their TYPES (metric, boolean, categorical), and their MINIMUM
and MAXIMUM values.


PARAMETER NAME
These are names used internally in Edisyn, but they should be relatively self-explanatory.
The one confusing one might be "operator6oscillatormode" etc., which is 1 if the oscillator [in this case #6] frequency is FIXED and 0 if it is not.
These parameters do not include the bytes for the PATCH NAME.
They do not include the so-called "Operator On/Off" parameters, which are not actually patch parameters and not part of a patch sysex file.

